Create your own original Kanji (= Japanese Characters) by combining radicals and parts. Over 12,000 combinations.

What you can do
• Choose a structure — left–right, crown, legs, hanging, surrounding road, enclosure — and combine parts
• Pick at random or choose each part yourself
• Save creations to your Shin Kanji Notebook
• Share as an image with friends or on social media
• Get notified when a combination matches a real existing character (structure and layout are checked)

Who it’s for
• Fans of Kanji (= Japanese Characters) and radicals
• Japanese learners who want to explore radicals playfully
• Anyone looking for original emblem or icon ideas
• People who want a quick creative brain teaser

Languages
Japanese / English / Spanish / Chinese

Invent a character that doesn’t exist yet — with Original Kanji Maker.
